Change(genesis='66602cd0dec37d58d03eec9518ca805a7ac38ea912d2b0c366a0b67b4b9f50b6', deps=(), event=Decided(decision='agentreadsmemory', at=datetime(2026, 10, 24, 0, 0, 0), actor='owner', title="The triage agent reads the secretary's memory, in the owner's words alone, and never writes it", body="*The agent reads the secretary's memory and never writes it* (the owner, 2026-10-24): `context` carries the newest facts and the record in the owner's words alone, in one answer of `CONTEXT_CAP` plus `[agent] memory_bytes`, the manual first (`agent::remembered`), and `recall` and `zoom` read further over the same clean set: the facts, the owner's own lines and the summaries made only of them (`Label::is_owners`); any other part shows its kinds alone. No verb writes a fact or a summary: a triage write is a card, and its lines in the `triage` conversation carry no words from mail, which `app/core/tests/triage_memory.rs` pins over every verb, so mail it reads reaches no later session through the memory.", rationale='The owner, 2026-10-24.', supersedes=()))